✅ Anthropic API key seems valid (status 200)
⚠️ Stripe responded with 401 – key may be invalid or account disabled
🔸 LOGFIRE_TOKEN not set – skipping

=== Done ===
```

*Because the provided values are synthetic “CANARY” secrets, you’ll most likely get the “❌” or “⚠️” lines – which is exactly what the script is meant to surface.*

