| ✅ | Item |
|----|------|
| ✔️ | Add **helmet**, **cors**, **rate‑limit** middleware. |
| ✔️ | Move route handlers into their own routers (`routes/users.js`, `routes/health.js`). |
| ✔️ | Introduce a **global error‑handling** middleware and an **async wrapper**. |
| ✔️ | Use **express‑validator** (or similar) for any future user‑supplied parameters. |
| ✔️ | Replace hard‑coded `3000` with `process.env.PORT`. |
| ✔️ | Add **graceful shutdown** handling for SIGTERM/SIGINT. |
| ✔️ | Swap `console.log` for a structured logger (e.g., `pino`). |
| ✔️ | Ensure no stack traces are leaked when `NODE_ENV=production`. |
| ✔️ | Run the app behind a TLS‑terminating reverse proxy in production. |

