> **Important** – All of these checks are *read‑only* or *no‑op* calls. They will not modify any of your data, but they do require outbound internet access and the relevant libraries (`pg`, `node-fetch`, `@aws-sdk/client-sts`, `stripe`). If you are on a restricted CI runner you may need to whitelist those hosts.

