=== Starting credential verification ===

[Postgres] ✅ SUCCESS
[Anthropic] ❌ FAILURE – HTTP 401 – {"type":"authentication_error","message":"Invalid API key"}
[Stripe] ✅ SUCCESS
[AWS STS] ❌ FAILURE – InvalidClientTokenId: The security token included in the request is invalid.
[Logfire] ❌ FAILURE – HTTP 403 – {"error":"invalid token"}

=== Done ===
